OL,3,GNEWSADebate on golf courses' future
OL,4,Asparked by housing plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe potential closure of a 60-year-old
OL,7,Fgolf course would be a "devastating"
OL,8,Floss to the community if plans to build
OL,9,Fhousing on the site are approved.
OL,11,FBloor Homes is proposing 200 homes at
OL,12,FShrivenham Park Golf Club in
OL,13,FOxfordshire, amid a warning from the
OL,14,Fgoverning body for amateur golf, over a
OL,15,Fsignificant rise in "proposals
OL,16,Finvolving partial or full loss of golf
OL,17,Fprovision" across the country, within
OL,18,Fthe last few years.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
