OL,3,GNEWSADebate on golf courses' future
OL,4,Asparked by housing plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FJim Boise, the club's greenkeeper and
OL,7,Fjunior players' coach, described the
OL,8,Fclub as a family and is among those
OL,9,Fopposing the plans.
OL,11,FThe proposals reflect a wider debate
OL,12,Facross the country and Ben Cooper, head
OL,13,Fof the Fabian Housing Centre, a
OL,14,Fleft-leaning think tank, says golf
OL,15,Fcourses are often a poor use of land
OL,16,Fthat could instead be used to build
OL,17,Fhomes.
